  "title": "More Than 1.5 Million Vehicles Recalled Over Fire Risks, Even When Parked",
  "summary": "A growing number of vehicle owners in the United States have been warned to do something that sounds unusual: park their cars outside. More than 1.5 million vehicles have been recalled this year because of fire risks that can develop even after the ignition has been switched off. The warnings have affected several major models, including Jeep Wranglers, Jeep Gladiators, Kia Tellurides and certain BMW vehicles. These safety campaigns, often described as \"park outside\" recalls, are becoming an i",
